      "message": "This is not setting the property on the fly, but saving the handle to set everything up at the end of animation parsing -- right?\n\nCan we try the on-the-fly approach first (also to match code comments):\n\n    if (auto slot \u003d fTextMap.find(node_name) !\u003d fTextMap.end()) {\n        auto handle \u003d t();\n        \n        auto txt \u003d t.get();\n        txt.fText \u003d slot.second;\n        t.set(txt);\n    }\n    \nThen 1) we don\u0027t need to store handles in maps anymore and 2) we can remove onAnimationBuilt().",
